information_available_at_decision:
In September 2023 a decision-maker knew:
- El Niño and positive-IOD conditions;
- the late-rain forecast for most of NTT;
- the provincial emergency alert and the six regency declarations.
The affected-person counts (BNPB, published by BPS in Feb 2024) were compiled later; the game shows them as the documented historical record of exposure.
